    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«If…» without hvis",
     "texto": [
      "You can also say «if» by putting the **verb first**, without hvis:\n\n- **Hvis** man vil more sig, er der mange steder at tage hen.\n- **Vil man** more sig, er der mange steder at tage hen.\n\nBoth mean: «If you want to have fun, there are plenty of places to go»."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    }
